Package: economic.toolkit
Type: Package
Title: Economic Data Analysis Toolkit
Version: 2.1.0
Date: 2026-01-23
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hyperpolymath Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "noreply@hyperpolymath.org"))
Description: Cross-platform economic data analysis toolkit providing access to
    10+ economic data sources (FRED, World Bank, IMF, OECD, ECB, BEA, Census,
    Eurostat, BIS, DBnomics) and economic analysis functions. Can connect to
    Julia backend via JuliaCall or use REST API mode.
